		{
			dependencies: [
				"79F969F9254C17AB"
				"2E5E8A5099C2CF75"
				"4245E9029CD3AE0B"
			]
			description: [
				"  A &#D2691ETremorzilla&r is a gigantic, resilient,     player-created, and &#D2691Ehighly                destructive&r neutral mob that can be     tamed and mounted. It has a               devastating energy beam attack that    can kill almost any living thing in          seconds and blast through the           terrain."
				""
				"在震地龙蛋上引爆&#D2691E核弹&r或&#D2691ENucleeper&r会生成&#D2691ETremorzilla&r，且必定为幼体。    &#D2691ETremorzilla&r会漫无目的地游荡，发出沉重的轰鸣声，并在其周围64格内的所有地面玩家屏幕上造成剧烈震动。"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&#D2691ETremorzilla&r 可以通过喂食至少 4 个 &#D2691EWaste Drums&r 来驯服 - 驯服后，它将不再接受任何。 第 4 个之后的每个 &#D2691EWaste Drum&r 都有 1/3 的几率驯服 Tremorzilla。 驯服后，它们可以像任何其他生物一样被控制和骑乘！"
				""
				"&#D2691ETremorzilla&r免疫坠落、火焰、岩浆、燃烧和冰冻，并且受到的击退减少100%，受到的投射物伤害减少65%。"
				""
				"由于自身能咆哮，&#D2691ETremorzilla&r在附近的Tremorsaurus或&#D2691ELuxtructosaurus&r咆哮时不会逃跑。因其体型巨大，也无法被Totem of Possession附身。"
			]
			hide_details_until_startable: true
			hide_until_deps_complete: false
			hide_until_deps_visible: false
